00:57:56.000 --> 00:58:15.940
<v Ira Glass>Yeah. There's a thing that people say to each other in movies that I've never, ever in my life had an impulse to say to somebody, but I do now. And that is, "Well, you carry her inside you."
<v Ira Glass>是啊。电影里人们常说一句话，我这辈子从来没有冲动对别人说过，但现在有了。那就是，“嗯，你把你携带在内心。”

00:58:15.940 --> 00:58:20.160
<v Lucy>Um, well, what does the other person in the movie say, then?
<v Lucy>嗯，那电影里的另一个人会说什么呢？

00:58:20.160 --> 00:58:22.080
<v Ira Glass>Usually, they're really moved.
<v Ira Glass>通常，他们真的很感动。

00:58:22.080 --> 00:58:23.280
<v Lucy>Oh, well.
<v Lucy>噢，好吧。

00:58:23.280 --> 00:58:29.230
<v Ira Glass>In the movies! Hold on for a second. This is the kind of music that we play in the movie. Hold on. Stay right there.
<v Ira Glass>在电影里！等一下。这是我们电影里播放的那种音乐。等一下。待在那儿别动。

00:58:29.230 --> 00:58:29.490
<v Ira Glass>[MUSIC PLAYING]
<v Ira Glass>[播放音乐]

00:58:29.490 --> 00:58:39.560
<v Ira Glass>It's going to be this kind of music. I'm going to say it to you again. Lucy, even though she's gone, you don't have to feel bad, because you carry her inside you.
<v Ira Glass>会是这种音乐。我再对你说一次。露西，即使她走了，你也不必感到不好，因为你把你携带在内心。

00:58:39.560 --> 00:58:42.930
<v Lucy>And then I would just say, "I guess you're right."
<v Lucy>然后我会回答，“我想你是对的。”

00:58:42.930 --> 00:58:43.820
<v Ira Glass>There you go.
<v Ira Glass>就是这样。

00:58:43.820 --> 00:58:45.700
<v Ira Glass>[CHUCKLING]
<v Ira Glass>[轻笑]

00:58:45.700 --> 00:58:54.190
<v Ira Glass>That was excellent line-reading.
<v Ira Glass>那是极好的台词朗读。

00:58:54.190 --> 00:59:12.740
<v Sean Cole>Ira Glass. That kid's got talent, right?
<v Sean Cole>艾拉·格拉斯。那孩子有天赋，对吧？

