01:00:01.850 --> 01:00:05.180
<v Ira Glass>With all due respect, I think you're trying to trick me.
<v Ira Glass>恕我直言，我认为你在耍我。

01:00:05.180 --> 01:00:10.180
<v Sean Cole>I'm Sean Cole. Call your mom, and join us next week for more stories of This American Life.
<v Sean Cole>我是肖恩·科尔。给妈妈打个电话，下周加入我们收听更多《美国生活》的故事。
